The bestax port

The port of this template to bestax-bulma (templates/rent in
https://github.com/allxsmith/bestax) is Copyright (c) 2026 Alex Smith, and is
released under the same MIT License terms as above. The images in public/ were
drawn for the port, not taken from the original; README.md says how, and
image-provenance.json records each one.
